	(text "SHEET 4/4: CAMERA, RADAR, SENSORS, FAN, TAMPER, MECHANICAL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d40959ce-a8c8-59e9-8772-33ef943df86f")
	)
	(text "J6 OV5640 24-pin DVP flex (pins 1, 23, 24 NC). AVDD/DOVDD on +2V8_CAM (R30 0R), DVDD +1V5_CAM. R57 33R series damping on PCLK at the connector (PCLK is driven by the sensor).\nJ_RADAR (JST-GH SM05B): 1 +3V3_SYS (always on, C34 10 uF + C35 100 nF), 2 GND, 3 RADAR_TX -> R59 1k -> UART1_RX, 4 RADAR_RX <- R60 1k <- UART1_TX, 5 RADAR_OUT -> IO2 (LP wake, R61 100k pull-down).\nNo discrete ESD diodes at J_RADAR (cost cut; the module is internal). The 1k resistors stop the radar back-powering the MCU's clamp diodes.\nFan: J_FAN pin 1 FAN_VCC (U10 load switch, C45 4.7 uF), pin 2 FAN_NEG -> Q2 AO3400A low side, gate R45 100R from FAN_PWM (IO15), R46 100k pull-down, D2 1N5819WS flyback across the fan.\nTamper: TAMPER_DRV (IO1, LP) -> R43 10k -> TAMPER_LOOP = 0.15 mm perimeter trace (F.Cu/B.Cu) -> J_TAMPER_LID (lid switch, in series) || R_TAMPER_BYP 0R -> TAMPER_SENSE (IO3, LP wake)\nwith R44 1M pull-up to +3V3_SYS and C44 10 nF. Hold TAMPER_DRV low (pad hold in deep sleep): intact loop = SENSE low (3.3 uA); cut trace or open lid = SENSE high -> wake.\nSelf-test: drive TAMPER_DRV high, SENSE must follow (detects a loop shorted to GND). Remove R_TAMPER_BYP when a lid switch is fitted to J_TAMPER_LID."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 41.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "39afc711-a234-5b4e-bd29-c19a57e38f4c")
	)
	(text "OV5640 24-pin DVP camera FPC, PCLK damping at the connector"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 52.8 0)
		(effects
