		)
		(uuid "b7a77ced-21c6-5c84-a108-b54a280d43d7")
	)
	(text "J_RADAR: HLK-LD2410S on always-on +3V3_SYS, 1k UART isolation, OUT wake pull-down (no discrete ESD diodes: cost cut)"
